1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,530
At seven in the morning, your dog looks

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,051
you in the eye and says:

3
00:00:05,071 --> 00:00:07,300
We need to talk about the cat.

4
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:10,545
In this world, every dog gets to talk.

5
00:00:10,565 --> 00:00:11,295
Once.

6
00:00:11,315 --> 00:00:12,935
For twenty-four hours.

7
00:00:12,955 --> 00:00:14,735
And Biscuit has been waiting eleven

8
00:00:14,755 --> 00:00:15,521
years.

9
00:00:16,271 --> 00:00:17,847
First, the complaints.

10
00:00:17,867 --> 00:00:19,617
The postman is a criminal.

11
00:00:19,682 --> 00:00:21,633
I've told you every single day.

12
00:00:21,653 --> 00:00:22,803
And the vacuum.

13
00:00:22,843 --> 00:00:25,316
Why do you keep a monster in the cupboard?

14
00:00:25,466 --> 00:00:26,706
Then breakfast.

15
00:00:26,726 --> 00:00:27,726
Dry food.

16
00:00:27,791 --> 00:00:28,641
Again.

17
00:00:28,706 --> 00:00:30,975
Eleven years of dry food.

18
00:00:30,995 --> 00:00:32,172
You eat socks!

19
00:00:32,192 --> 00:00:33,392
Socks are a treat.

20
00:00:33,432 --> 00:00:35,123
There's a difference.

21
00:00:35,573 --> 00:00:37,933
By nine, Mum is laughing so hard she's

22
00:00:37,953 --> 00:00:38,895
crying.

23
00:00:38,915 --> 00:00:40,469
Say something about Dad.

24
00:00:40,489 --> 00:00:41,594
He sneaks me cheese.

25
00:00:41,614 --> 00:00:43,219
And he sings in the shower.

26
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:44,382
Badly.

27
00:00:44,532 --> 00:00:46,232
Dad goes very red.

28
00:00:46,522 --> 00:00:48,277
You take Biscuit to the park.

29
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:50,086
Every dog is talking.

30
00:00:50,106 --> 00:00:52,381
A poodle is reviewing the benches.

31
00:00:52,416 --> 00:00:54,511
A husky won't stop shouting.

32
00:00:54,531 --> 00:00:56,511
Biscuit just walks next to you.

33
00:00:56,531 --> 00:00:57,401
Slowly.

34
00:00:57,421 --> 00:00:59,003
Slower than last year.

35
00:00:59,753 --> 00:01:01,449
Can we sit down?

36
00:01:01,599 --> 00:01:02,284
You sit.

37
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:03,909
He climbs up next to you.

38
00:01:03,929 --> 00:01:05,565
It takes him two tries.

39
00:01:05,585 --> 00:01:07,065
I need to tell you some things.

40
00:01:07,085 --> 00:01:08,962
While I still can.

41
00:01:09,112 --> 00:01:10,424
The jokes stop.

42
00:01:10,444 --> 00:01:11,804
When you were seven, you cried under

43
00:01:11,824 --> 00:01:13,199
the bed after school.

44
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,778
Every day for a month.

45
00:01:14,798 --> 00:01:16,073
I lay next to you.

46
00:01:16,113 --> 00:01:17,713
That was my job.

47
00:01:17,733 --> 00:01:19,127
I didn't think you knew.

48
00:01:19,147 --> 00:01:20,042
I always know.

49
00:01:20,062 --> 00:01:22,242
Your dad cries in the car sometimes.

50
00:01:22,262 --> 00:01:23,992
Your mum talks to me when nobody calls

51
00:01:24,012 --> 00:01:24,718
back.

52
00:01:24,738 --> 00:01:25,838
I hold all of it.

53
00:01:25,878 --> 00:01:27,340
I don't mind.

54
00:01:27,890 --> 00:01:29,645
Then he says the thing you weren't ready

55
00:01:29,665 --> 00:01:30,240
for.

56
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,390
My legs hurt now.

57
00:01:31,410 --> 00:01:32,140
The vet knows.

58
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,424
You don't.

59
00:01:34,974 --> 00:01:36,654
That evening, the whole family sits

60
00:01:36,674 --> 00:01:38,269
on the floor.

61
00:01:38,289 --> 00:01:39,938
Nobody watches TV.

62
00:01:39,958 --> 00:01:41,428
Nobody checks a phone.

63
00:01:41,448 --> 00:01:41,828
Mum.

64
00:01:41,848 --> 00:01:43,968
Thank you for the blanket by the radiator.

65
00:01:43,988 --> 00:01:44,492
Dad.

66
00:01:44,512 --> 00:01:46,551
Keep the cheese a secret.

67
00:01:46,701 --> 00:01:48,308
And then he looks at you.

68
00:01:48,328 --> 00:01:50,596
You were my favourite job.

69
00:01:51,146 --> 00:01:53,213
At midnight, he stops talking.

70
00:01:53,233 --> 00:01:54,748
He just thumps his tail.

71
00:01:54,768 --> 00:01:55,712
Twice.

72
00:01:55,732 --> 00:01:57,594
You know exactly what it means.

73
00:01:57,614 --> 00:01:59,146
I love you too, Biscuit.

74
00:01:59,796 --> 00:02:01,562
What would your dog say to you?
